sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Foydalanuvchi
    participant App as Flutter App
    participant Local as SQLite (offline)
    participant Sync as SyncEngine
    participant API as Core Backend
    participant AI as AI Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>App: "85000 so'm ovqatga" (ovoz/matn/chek)
    App->>AI: kategoriya/summa aniqlash so'rovi (online bo'lsa)
    AI-->>App: {category: "Food", amount: 85000}
    App->>Local: tranzaksiya yozish (sync_status=pending)
    Local-->>App: OK (darhol UI yangilanadi)

    alt Internet mavjud
        App->>Sync: push pending yozuvlar
        Sync->>API: POST /api/v1/transactions
        API->>DB: INSERT transaction
        API-->>Sync: 201 Created {id, version}
        Sync->>Local: sync_status=synced, version=...
    else Offline
        App-->>U: "Offline saqlandi, internet bo'lganda sinxronlanadi"
    end

    API->>AI: anomaliya tekshiruvi (async)
    AI-->>API: risk_score
    API->>API: agar risk_score yuqori bo'lsa notification yaratish
